  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Korttidsinsatser m.m. inom ramen f&#xF6;r EU:s gemensamma s&#xE4;kerhets- och f&#xF6;rsvarspolitik</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short-term activities etc. within the European Common Security and Defence Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Among others that seconded staff are well-trained and prepared for their assignments and that the Swedish National Courts Administration supports the missions through its short-term activities. Also that personnel sent out to CSDP missions have a sound and thourough knowledge on sexual and gender based violence in a conflict setting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bl.a. att sekonderad personal &#xE4;r utbildad inf&#xF6;r sina uppdrag och att Domstolsverket st&#xF6;djer insatserna genom sina korttidsinsatser. &#xC4;ven att insatspersonal f&#xE5;r med sig mer kunskap om k&#xF6;nsbaserat och sexualiserat v&#xE5;ld n&#xE4;r de &#xE5;ker ut till insatser i konfliktomr&#xE5;den.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsf&#xF6;rberedande utbildning och kompetensh&#xF6;jande insatser samt annat insatsn&#xE4;ra arbete, bl.a. l&#xE4;rarbidrag till en kurs vid European Security and Defence College (ESDC). Kursen handlar om att &#xF6;ka kompetensen hos insatspersonal n&#xE4;r det g&#xE4;ller sexualiserat och k&#xF6;nsbaserat v&#xE5;ld i konfliktsituationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-deployment training and short-term activities to support the missions as well as other work closely related to the missions, such as contributing with a teacher to a course at the European Security and Defence College (ESDC). The aim of the course at the ESDC is to enhance the capacity of mission personnel to integrate a Sexual and gender based violence perspective as part of their daily work.</narrative>
  </description>
